% Fixtures for the filters biber applies to a name before it compares or
% initials it: the `nosort` patterns that drop a short dash-joined prefix from a
% name part, and the `noinit` ones that drop a lowercase such prefix from the
% initials. Both are biber defaults (Constants.pm:258/266); every expected string
% was read off real biber.

